# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — autotools 项目 trampoline/闭包可执行内存页在 OHOS 编译期缺分支 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-07
# Software: libffcall 2.5(任何含 trampoline/闭包机制、依赖可执行内存页的 autotools 库)
# Gate: make / conan create build()
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-libffcall-2.5-trampoline-exec-page
title: autotools 库 trampoline/闭包机制在 HarmonyOS 上找不到可执行内存页方案,编译期 #error "Don't know how to make memory pages executable."
trigger_tool: configure / make / conan create build()
phase: build
error_signature: Don.t know how to make memory pages executable|EXECUTABLE_VIA|trampoline\.c.*#error
severity: 3
category: platform|autotools|memory|compat
match_keywords: trampoline, closure, executable memory, memory pages executable, mprotect, mmap,
  EXECUTABLE_VIA_MMAP_THEN_MPROTECT, __ANDROID__, __OHOS__, SELinux, W^X, PROT_EXEC,
  libffi, callback, ffcall
keywords: trampoline, closure, executable page, memory pages executable, autotools,
  HarmonyOS, __OHOS__, __ANDROID__, mprotect, mmap, SELinux
approach: 把 trampoline 机制源码的 `#elif defined __ANDROID__ && HAVE_MPROTECT_AFTER_MMAP_CAN_EXEC < 0`
  分支扩展为 `(defined __ANDROID__ || defined __OHOS__)` 走 EXECUTABLE_VIA_MMAP_THEN_MPROTECT
  (mmap RW → mprotect RX);若项目存在多份 trampoline 副本(如 libffcall 的 trampoline/ 与
  callback/trampoline_r/)需逐个同步;补丁形式随配方分发
root_cause: HarmonyOS(SELinux 控制内存保护)上 configure 对 mprotect after mmap 可执行能力的
  探测结果为 "determined by SELinux at runtime"(编译期无法静态确认),映射为
  HAVE_MPROTECT_AFTER_MMAP_CAN_EXEC=-1,导致 trampoline.c 的宏选择链落到 #error
  "Don't know how to make memory pages executable."。项目默认只对 __ANDROID__ 开放
  mmap-then-mprotect 绕过分支,未覆盖 __OHOS__。
affected_scope: 所有在 HarmonyOS PC(aarch64)上编译、内含 trampoline/闭包/JIT 跳板机制的
  autotools 库(closures 首类函数、FFI 库);conftest 运行时探测在本平台无法直接判定,
  与 E045(运行时 W^X 拒绝 RWX)同源但发生在编译期宏选择
verification_cmd: grep -n 'memory pages executable' trampoline/trampoline.c;
  grep -c __OHOS__ trampoline/trampoline.c;
  gcc -E -dM -include trampoline/trampoline.c /dev/null | grep -E 'EXECUTABLE_VIA'
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: extend-android-branch-ohos
rec_description: 在 trampoline 宏选择链中把 Android 专用分支扩展为同时覆盖 __OHOS__,
  选用 EXECUTABLE_VIA_MMAP_THEN_MPROTECT(mmap PROT_READ|PROT_WRITE → 填码 → mprotect PROT_EXEC),
  与 HarmonyOS 的 W^X 策略兼容(实测可执行)
rec_command: sed -i 's/defined __ANDROID__ && HAVE_MPROTECT_AFTER_MMAP_CAN_EXEC < 0/(defined __ANDROID__ || defined __OHOS__) \&\& HAVE_MPROTECT_AFTER_MMAP_CAN_EXEC < 0/' trampoline/trampoline.c
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: 正式 patch 文件承载,trampoline 多处副本逐一应用,conandata.yml 登记
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: configure-ac-force
fallback_description: 若项目 configure.ac 允许,可强制该检测为肯定(不推荐,会误判 SELinux 实际策略)
fallback_command: echo 'ffcall_cv_mmap_mprotect_can_exec=yes' >> config.cache
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: 不推荐
principles: HarmonyOS SELinux 使 mprotect-after-mmap 可执行性在编译期不可静态探测(-1);
  mmap(RW)+mprotect(RX) 分步映射与 W^X 策略兼容;__ANDROID__ 分支是 OHOS 最近的参照先例
caused_by: configure 探测 mprotect can exec 返回 "determined by SELinux at runtime"(=-1),
  trampoline 宏链未提供 __OHOS__ 命中分支(实例:libffcall 2.5 trampoline/trampoline.c:103)
causes: 编译期 #error "Don't know how to make memory pages executable",库整体构建失败
similar_to: E045(运行时 W^X 拒绝 mmap RWX——同源策略,编译期 vs 运行时两个错误面)
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
